GDAL/OGR  (https://gdal.org)  -  MIT/X licence
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* src/formats/dgn.js re-implements, in JavaScript, the DGN v7 (ISFF) element
  decoding logic of GDAL's "dgnlib" (ogr/ogrsf_frmts/dgn), originally written by
  Frank Warmerdam: element header layout, TCB working units and global origin,
  VAX D-float decoding, colour table handling (the last table counts),
  arc/ellipse/text/cell/complex element layouts, the 3D quaternion convention
  (DGNQuaternionToMatrix / DGNRotationToQuaternion), attribute linkage walking and
  the shape fill linkage (DGNGetLinkage / DGNGetShapeFillInfo), 16-bit text
  unpacking, B-spline header fields and the reference file group data level.
  No GDAL source code is included verbatim.
* src/palettes.js contains two colour tables (the 256-entry DXF colour index
  table and the default DGN v7 colour table) obtained by running GDAL's OGR DXF
  and DGN readers on synthetic files (tools/extract_palettes.py).
* src/formats/dgn-write.js writes DGN v7 elements using the same element layouts
  (the inverse of the decoding above; the fill linkage bytes are the ones GDAL's
  DGNAddShapeFillInfo writes). No GDAL source code is included verbatim.
* src/formats/dgn-seed.js embeds the first three elements (TCB, digitizer setup,
  level symbology) of GDAL's seed_2d.dgn data file, used to start new DGN files
  (generated by tools/make_dgn_seed.py).
* Test oracles in tests/fixtures/*.ogr.json are produced by GDAL's OGR DGN
  reader, and synthetic test drawings are created with GDAL's OGR DGN writer.

